      "start_time": "2026-08-31T09:05:01.226000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-08-31T09:05:04.893000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Alex Kim"
      },
      "text": "Which, when I like looked at the dependency upgrade for Falcon, nothing jumped like out.",
