      "end_time": "2026-08-31T09:05:09.961000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Alex Kim"
      },
      "text": "Which, I spent a dozen tickets on the like backlog and it's mostly what we talked about...",
      "start_time": "2026-08-31T09:05:10.058000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-08-31T09:05:15.725000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Ruth Abebe"
      },
      "text": "And.",
      "start_time": "2026-08-31T09:05:15.834000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-08-31T09:05:16.434000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Ruth Abebe"
      },
      "text": "To be fair, the runbook took like twelve steps last time, anyway",
      "start_time": "2026-08-31T09:05:16.494000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-08-31T09:05:20.494000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Ruth Abebe"
      },
      "text": "Right, so that's basically what we saw with the linting rules on the payments migration.",
      "start_time": "2026-08-31T09:05:20.498000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-08-31T09:05:25.498000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Ruth Abebe"
      },
      "text": "But I'd rather keep it behind a flag than look at it with fresh eyes and stuff.",
      "start_time": "2026-08-31T09:05:25.537000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-08-31T09:05:31.203000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Ruth Abebe"
      },
      "text": "And then I spent twelve steps on the canary like setup and the feedback was mixed.",
