      "end_time": "2026-08-31T09:05:45.833000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Ruth Abebe"
      },
      "text": "From my side,",
      "start_time": "2026-08-31T09:05:45.837000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-08-31T09:05:46.837000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "honestly the next steps only needs twenty minutes if we just ship the smaller version.",
      "start_time": "2026-08-31T09:05:46.886000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-08-31T09:05:51.886000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Ruth Abebe"
      },
      "text": "Just to add, we lost half a day on the dependency upgrade last week, if helps.",
      "start_time": "2026-08-31T09:05:52.081000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-08-31T09:05:57.414000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "I think the staging deploy took like a couple of hours last time.",
      "start_time": "2026-08-31T09:05:57.427000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-08-31T09:06:01.761000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Inês Duarte"
      },
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "start_time": "2026-08-31T09:06:01.811000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-08-31T09:06:02.411000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "Yeah, I think the caching layer is in good shape and the notes from last time is not where I'd want it, so maybe draw it on a whiteboard. And my worry with the error budget is that it creates more support load. What's the plan for the requirements? So yeah, the short version is the linting rules is mostly cosmetic, right. The thing I'd push on is the canary setup, in my opinion. Yeah. I don't know if the preview environments is really like the issue, I think. Okay, for Falcon, I think the edge cases is the part that's in good shape.",
      "start_time": "2026-08-31T09:06:02.447000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-08-31T09:06:37.114000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "And...",
      "start_time": "2026-08-31T09:06:37.200000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-08-31T09:06:37.800000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Sam, you're up.",
