      "end_time": "2026-08-31T09:06:51.535000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Ruth Abebe"
      },
      "text": "Just to add, the logging format is not where I'd want want it, at least for now. I'm not convinced the backlog is still pretty rough, anyway. And then the notes from last time took like twelve steps last time, more or less.",
      "start_time": "2026-08-31T09:06:52.143000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-08-31T09:07:06.476000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Sam Patel"
      },
      "text": "Okay, I talked to the new folks about the pagination bug and they had lot of opinions. Yeah no, like I don't know if like the metrics is really the issue.",
      "start_time": "2026-08-31T09:07:06.537000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-08-31T09:07:16.871000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "And.",
